    "summary": "Costs 1 CP. During your [Shooting phase](vsdata:core-rule/shooting-phase) or either [Fight phase](vsdata:core-rule/fight-phase), select one of your units using these keywords as alternatives: **INQUISITOR**, **INQUISITORIAL AGENTS** and **ORDO MALLEUS**. Find one enemy **DAEMON** no more than 12 inches away and visible to the selected unit. Test that enemy for Battle-shock. If it fails, attacks from your **AGENTS OF THE IMPERIUM** gain [**[DEVASTATING WOUNDS](vsdata:weapon-ability/devastating-wounds)**] against it for this phase.",
